{
  "dashboard_name": "EdTech Platform Dashboard Template",
  "source": "analytics",
  "report": "# EdTech Platform Operations Report\n\n## Overview\nThis dashboard provides Learnova Technologies with a complete picture of platform health, learner engagement, course completion performance, monthly active users, and the new enrollment pipeline across all learning products.\n\n## Key Metrics\n- Active Learners: 28,400\n- Course Completion Rate: 62.3%\n- Monthly Active Users: 11,200\n- Avg Session Duration: 34 min\n- New Enrollments MTD: 1,840\n\n## Insights\n- Course completion at 62.3% is below the 70% target — the AI Tutoring Feature in development is expected to improve learner retention and reduce drop-off.\n- MAU of 11,200 against 28,400 active learners indicates a 39% monthly engagement ratio; push notification and drip email campaigns could improve this.\n- Platform outage incident should be tracked to resolution; SLA breach could impact enterprise contract renewals with corporate clients.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Active Learners",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Active Learners",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "Education",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"status": "Active"}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "28400"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Course Completion Rate",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Course Completion Rate",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "Education",
            "operation": "percentage",
            "filters": {"status": "Completed"}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "62.3%"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "name": "Enrollment by Subject Category",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Enrollments by Category",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "Education",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {},
            "group_by": "subject_category"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "bar chart"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "name": "Monthly Active User Trend",
      "data_config": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Monthly Active Users",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "Education",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"active_in_period": true}
          }
        ],
        "group_by": ["custom_dates"],
        "date_from": "2025-01-01",
        "date_to": "2025-12-31",
        "date_interval": "monthly",
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "pie",
      "name": "Learner Engagement Distribution",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Learners by Engagement Tier",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "Education",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {},
            "group_by": "engagement_tier"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "pie chart"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Open Platform & Support Items",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Open Items",
            "data_source": "ticketing",
            "module": "Education",
            "operation": "list",
            "filters": {"status": ["Open", "In Progress"]}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "item list"
      },
      "column_count": 4,
      "column_width": 200
    }
  ]
}
